          <attvalue for="topology_description" value="Figure 9: An overview over the structure of a trajectory: We first present the system prompt, demonstration (optional), and issue statement. The agent then interacts in turn with the environment. Past observations may be collapsed, i.e. we truncate any long output, as described in Section 3."/>
